Author: LittleCube, retargeted for Kirby: Planet Robobot

Version: # Plugin version
  Major: 0
  Minor: 0
  Revision: 1

Targets: 00040000001BB800, 0004000000183600

Title: Kirby Planet Robobot Archipelago Plugin

Summary: Connect to an Archipelago multiworld from a real 3DS!

Description: |
  A plain memory pipe. It listens on UDP port 45987 and answers read and write
  requests for the game's memory, which is how the Archipelago client watches
  your progress and hands you items. It holds no game logic of its own.

  Originally written by LittleCube for A Link Between Worlds. The only change
  is the Targets line above, because a plugin will not load under a title it
  does not declare.

Compatibility: Any

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: true
